{"_id":"6a2ff9882204ffbc59e5a77b","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"PHfLEgeEMChsSOSIgMoWH","description":"# Correlation Matrix\n\nA correlation matrix shows the pairwise correlation coefficients between all numeric columns in a dataset. It is computed with `df.corr()` and typically visualized as a heatmap using Seaborn. It is a key EDA tool for identifying which features are strongly related, which helps with feature selection and multicollinearity detection.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Correlation Matrix, Demystified","url":"https://medium.com/data-science/correlation-matrix-demystified-3ae3405c86c1","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf3"},{"type":"article","title":"Data Science - Statistics Correlation Matrix","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/datascience/ds_stat_correlation_matrix.asp","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf4"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:09:28.770Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/PHfLEgeEMChsSOSIgMoWH.md"}